## 8. Query Patterns & Performance

### Critical Query Patterns

| Pattern | Description | Tables | Expected Frequency | Target Latency | Index Strategy |
|---------|-----------|--------|-------------------|---------------|---------------|
| User lookup | Find user by email | users | High | < 5ms | Unique index on email |
| ... | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |

### Denormalization Decisions
| What | Why | Trade-off | Sync Strategy |
|------|-----|-----------|--------------|
| ... | Performance optimization for [query] | Write complexity | Trigger / Application logic / CDC |

### Partitioning Strategy (if applicable)
- Which tables to partition
- Partition key and strategy (range, hash, list)
- Partition lifecycle (archival, dropping old partitions)

## 9. Replication & Consistency

- Read replica configuration
- Replication lag tolerance per use case
- Consistency requirements per operation (strong vs eventual)
- Conflict resolution for concurrent writes

## 10. Backup & Recovery

- Backup frequency and type (full, incremental, WAL archiving)
- Point-in-time recovery window
- Backup testing schedule
- Cross-region backup replication
- Recovery time estimates

